<h2>New comment on {{cardTitle}}</h2>
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p><strong>{{authorName}}</strong> commented on a card you're following:</p>
<blockquote style="border-left:3px solid #e7e5e4; padding:12px 16px; margin:16px 0; color:#57534e; font-style:italic;">
  {{commentBody}}
</blockquote>
<a href="{{cardUrl}}" class="btn">View Comment</a>

